    "etf.rsst.stack": { "zh": "管理期貨（趨勢）", "en": "Managed futures (trend)" },
    "etf.rsst.tagline": { "zh": "底下全倉大盤美股，上面再疊一層會做多也會做空的管理期貨趨勢策略。", "en": "Full US large-cap equity exposure underneath, with a managed-futures trend overlay that can go long or short." },
    "etf.rsst.tim_note": { "zh": "Tim Wei 實驗有配置 RSST，與 RSSB、RSSY、RSIT 搭配使用。", "en": "Tim Wei holds RSST alongside RSSB, RSSY, and RSIT." },
    "etf.rsst.why.0.desc": { "zh": "底倉 100% 配置<strong>美國大盤股票</strong>（S&P 500），確保能完全參與美股長期向上的經濟成長紅利。同時疊加 100% 的<strong>管理期貨趨勢</strong>（Trend-following）策略，在不同的總體經濟週期與大波動中尋求非對稱的絕對回報。", "en": "Layer 1 is <strong>100% US large-cap stocks</strong> (S&P 500) to participate in long-run US growth. Layer 2 adds <strong>100% managed-futures trend</strong> seeking asymmetric absolute return across macro regimes and volatility spikes." },
    "etf.rsst.why.0.title": { "zh": "「美股 beta」與「管理期貨 alpha」雙管齊下", "en": "US beta and managed-futures alpha" },
    "etf.rsst.why.1.desc": { "zh": "歷史上，CTA 趨勢策略在股市發生大跌、系統性危機或高通膨環境下（如 2008 年、2022 年），往往能透過做空股指、做多商品/美元等方式獲取正報酬，提供與股票市場<strong>極佳的互補性與下檔防護</strong>。", "en": "Historically, CTA trend strategies have often posted positive returns in equity crashes, systemic stress, and high inflation (e.g. 2008, 2022) by shorting equity indices and going long commodities or the dollar—offering <strong>complementary downside protection</strong> versus stocks." },
    "etf.rsst.why.1.title": { "zh": "危機阿爾法（Crisis Alpha）的分散效果", "en": "Crisis alpha diversification" },
    "etf.rsst.why.2.desc": { "zh": "只要將現有投資組合中的 20% 美股部位賣掉，改為配置 20% 的 RSST，即可在「<strong>不減少美股曝險</strong>」的同時，無額外資金負擔地在資產組合中<strong>疊加 20% 的管理期貨趨勢策略</strong>，實現真正的資金解耦。", "en": "Sell 20% of an existing US equity sleeve and buy 20% RSST to keep <strong>unchanged US stock exposure</strong> while <strong>stacking 20% managed-futures trend</strong> with no extra cash—true capital decoupling." },
    "etf.rsst.why.2.title": { "zh": "無痛升級投資組合", "en": "Painless portfolio upgrade" },
    "etf.rsst.why.3.desc": { "zh": "此策略並非主觀交易，而是透過量化模型複製官方管理期貨趨勢指數。截至 2026 年 Q1 季報，複製模型 3 年日相關係數高達 <strong>0.84</strong>，追蹤誤差控制在 <strong>5.4%</strong>，展現穩健的複製能力。", "en": "Not discretionary trading—a quantitative replica of the sponsor managed-futures trend index. As of Q1 2026 commentary, the blend model’s 3-year daily correlation is <strong>0.84</strong> with tracking error <strong>5.4%</strong>." },
    "etf.rsst.why.3.title": { "zh": "高精準度的官方模型複製", "en": "High-fidelity index replication" },
