    "guide.backtest.growth.note": { "zh": "※「歷史回測」年化報酬數據源自官方歷史回測資料；「20 年後估算終值」為本站依此報酬率複利自行推算，非官方數據，亦非逐日回測曲線。", "en": "Historical backtest returns are from official sources; the 20-year estimated value is compounded locally from those returns—not official data or a daily backtest curve." },
