    "guide.holdings.layer1.note": { "zh": "現股 ETF 加股指期貨；期貨列的是保證金市值/NAV，不是 1:1 名義曝險", "en": "Stock ETFs plus equity futures; futures show margin/NAV, not 1:1 notional" },
