    "guide.learn.promo.note": { "zh": "各檔真正不同的地方在第二層。專頁用白話拆解「多出來的 100% 在買什麼」，不含第一層。", "en": "What really differs across tickers is Layer 2. That page explains what the extra 100% buys—Layer 1 is not covered there." },
    "guide.learn.promo.title": { "zh": "第二層策略才是關卡", "en": "Layer 2 is the fork in the road" },
    "guide.learn.stack.foot": { "zh": "每投入 $1 美元，即疊加 $1 基礎曝險 ＋ $1 策略曝險，目標達成 200% 總資產曝險（透過期貨等衍生工具實現，非保證）", "en": "Every $1 invested stacks $1 base exposure + $1 overlay strategy, targeting 200% total asset exposure (via futures and derivatives, not guaranteed)" },
